WEBVTT

43:02.690 --> 43:05.401
If you took your gloves off
to find your cock to have a piss,

43:05.526 --> 43:08.571
you lost a finger to the frost.

43:08.696 --> 43:10.489
And all in darkness.

43:13.826 --> 43:16.162
You don't know cold.

43:16.287 --> 43:18.205
Neither of you do.

43:20.875 --> 43:23.043
The horses died first.

43:25.421 --> 43:28.757
We didn't have enough
to feed them, to keep them warm.
